From 31a042d00581ed914d30f17cca1ed0e70e99d21f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Amicabile <diego.amicabile@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 09:21:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Avoid casting regeneration while scoring preparation spells

Return its preparation score during simulation, as the other preparation spells do. Queue Rapid Regeneration only when the chosen action is executed.
---
 src/borg/borg-fight-perm.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/borg/borg-fight-perm.c b/src/borg/borg-fight-perm.c
index aff0e0ffd..09c7f81ed 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-fight-perm.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-fight-perm.c
@@ -459,6 +459,10 @@ static int borg_perma_aux_regen(void)
                                    : borg.trait[BI_CURSP] / 10))
         return 0;
 
+    /* Simulation */
+    if (borg_simulate)
+        return 1;
+
     /* do it! */
     if (borg_spell(RAPID_REGENERATION)) {
         /* No resting to recoup mana */
-- 
2.53.0

